{"meta":{"format_version":"5.0","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"ballista_fixed","model_identifier":"ballista_fixed","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","multi_file_ruleset":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# ballista_fixed\n\nFixed ballista for the Citadel's engine platform (Patch 5): the ballista on a bolted timber base with iron straps, no wheels and no tow tongue; arms and stock shortened to fit the platform. It is built from `ballista` and keeps its bones and clips except the wheels; it cannot move.\n\n- Placement: its origin sits on the Citadel's `slot_engine`, facing -Z; its crewmen stand at `slot_crew_1` and `slot_crew_2`.\n- Bounds: x -29..29, y 0..47, z -34..24 units.\n- Texture: 256 x 128, 1 px per unit, flat pixel-art tones per material.\n- Cubes: 56.\n\n## Clips\n\n- `idle` (4 s, loop)\n- `aim` (4 s, loop)\n- `fire` (1.2 s)\n- `reload` (3.6 s)\n- `damaged` (0.7 s)\n- `destroyed` (2 s)\n\n(`move` and `move_towed` are removed: a fixed engine never moves.)\n\n## Attachment and effect points (empty groups)\n\n- `slot_bolt` at (0, 42.5, 1.4)\n- `slot_crew_1` at (16, 0, 28)\n- `slot_crew_2` at (-16, 0, 28)"},"resolution":{"width":256,"height":128},"elements":[{"name":"beam_r","box_uv":false,"render_order":"default","locked":false,"export":true,"scope":0,"allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[9,11,-18.3],"to":[12.5,16,20.3],"autouv":0,"color":0,"origin":[0,0,46],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[180,68,184,73],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[144,63,183,68],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[184,68,188,73],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[183,63,222,68],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[42,0,46,39],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[46,0,50,39],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"3fe32261-e7b3-5ed2-a20b-795afa2579a8"},{"name":"team_stripe_r","box_uv":false,"render_order":"default","locked":false,"export":true,"scope":0,"allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[12.4,12.5,-14],"to":[12.7,14,16],"autouv":0,"color":0,"origin":